<strong>dev / staging</strong> environment. For production, see <a href=\"https://examplecorp.io\">examplecorp.io</a>.</div>\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"brand\">ExampleCorp <span>⚜ dev</span></div>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"/services\">Services</a>\n      <a href=\"/team\">Team</a>\n      <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a>\n      <a href=\"/dashboard\">Sign in</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>Custom SaaS for Louisiana businesses.</h1>\n    <p>We build operations software for oil &amp; gas, medical billing, and real estate teams across the Gulf South. Twelve people, Baton Rouge.</p>\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"/contact\">Talk to us →</a>\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Oil &amp; Gas Ops</h3><p>Field ticket reconciliation, lease compliance dashboards, and SCADA bridges for independent producers.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Medical Billing</h3><p>HIPAA-aligned claim scrubbing and patient statement workflows for small physician groups.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Real Estate Tools</h3><p>MLS sync, commission splits, and broker dashboards for Louisiana &amp; Texas regional brokerages.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Team</h3><p>12 people in Baton Rouge — 3 leadership, 6 engineers, 3 design &amp; ops. We've been shipping since 2017.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Stack</h3><p>Next.js, Node 20, Postgres, AWS. Built &amp; deployed from this dev environment.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h3>Contact</h3><p>hello@examplecorp.io · (225) 555-0142 · Baton Rouge, LA</p></div>\n  </section>\n  <footer>\n    © 2026 ExampleCorp, LLC · <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"/terms\">Terms</a> · build a4f1c8b · deployed 2026-05-27\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
